;    1: TDecorate(count=8, unk2=65535, unk3=4294967295, unk4=0, unk5=1, unk6=0, unk7=4294967295, unk8=, ruby=, unk10=4294967295, unk11=4294967295)
;    2: TDecorate(count=404, unk2=16776960, unk3=4294967295, unk4=0, unk5=1, unk6=0, unk7=4294967295, unk8=, ruby=, unk10=4294967295, unk11=4294967295)
;    3: TDecorate(count=381, unk2=16755370, unk3=4294967295, unk4=0, unk5=1, unk6=0, unk7=4294967295, unk8=, ruby=, unk10=4294967295, unk11=4294967295)
;    4: TDecorate(count=186, unk2=16757864, unk3=4294967295, unk4=0, unk5=1, unk6=0, unk7=4294967295, unk8=, ruby=, unk10=4294967295, unk11=4294967295)
;    5: TDecorate(count=14, unk2=6413008, unk3=4294967295, unk4=0, unk5=1, unk6=0, unk7=4294967295, unk8=, ruby=, unk10=4294967295, unk11=4294967295)
;    6: TDecorate(count=20, unk2=8388863, unk3=4294967295, unk4=0, unk5=1, unk6=0, unk7=4294967295, unk8=, ruby=, unk10=4294967295, unk11=4294967295)
;    7: TDecorate(count=12, unk2=255, unk3=4294967295, unk4=0, unk5=1, unk6=0, unk7=4294967295, unk8=, ruby=, unk10=4294967295, unk11=4294967295)
;    8: TDecorate(count=1, unk2=16776960, unk3=4294967295, unk4=0, unk5=1, unk6=0, unk7=4294967295, unk8=, ruby=は, unk10=4294967295, unk11=4294967295)
;    9: TDecorate(count=1, unk2=4294967295, unk3=4294967295, unk4=0, unk5=1, unk6=0, unk7=4294967295, unk8=, ruby=は, unk10=4294967295, unk11=4294967295)
;   10: TDecorate(count=1, unk2=4294967295, unk3=4294967295, unk4=0, unk5=1, unk6=0, unk7=4294967295, unk8=, ruby=・, unk10=4294967295, unk11=4294967295)
;   11: TDecorate(count=15, unk2=16755455, unk3=4294967295, unk4=0, unk5=1, unk6=0, unk7=4294967295, unk8=, ruby=, unk10=4294967295, unk11=4294967295)
;   12: TDecorate(count=66, unk2=16755455, unk3=4294967295, unk4=0, unk5=1, unk6=0, unk7=4294967295, unk8=ＭＳ Ｐゴシック, ruby=, unk10=4294967295, unk11=4294967295)
;   13: TDecorate(count=4, unk2=16755370, unk3=4294967295, unk4=0, unk5=1, unk6=0, unk7=4294967295, unk8=ＭＳ Ｐゴシック, ruby=, unk10=4294967295, unk11=4294967295)
;   14: TDecorate(count=5, unk2=11271932, unk3=4294967295, unk4=0, unk5=1, unk6=0, unk7=4294967295, unk8=ＭＳ Ｐゴシック, ruby=, unk10=4294967295, unk11=4294967295)
;   15: TDecorate(count=4, unk2=16776960, unk3=4294967295, unk4=0, unk5=1, unk6=0, unk7=4294967295, unk8=ＭＳ Ｐゴシック, ruby=, unk10=4294967295, unk11=4294967295)
;   16: TDecorate(count=2, unk2=11271932, unk3=4294967295, unk4=0, unk5=1, unk6=0, unk7=4294967295, unk8=, ruby=, unk10=4294967295, unk11=4294967295)
;   17: TDecorate(count=3, unk2=16777215, unk3=4294967295, unk4=0, unk5=1, unk6=0, unk7=4294967295, unk8=, ruby=, unk10=4294967295, unk11=4294967295)
; Display conditions:
;    0: TWdCondition(count=4651, target=)
; Links:
;    0: TWdLink(count=4226, event=, unk3=)
;---------------------------------------
; BEGIN DECOMPILED SCRIPT
;---------------------------------------
<SCENARIO VER="105">
{WAIT "2000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{PLAYSND "環境音\アポカリプティック2.ogg" "SE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
{WAIT "3000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
{CREATECG "文字カウント画像" "グラフィック\システム\文字カウント画像.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "1" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
<TXSPN>The one at Toyotake Station was the first; the one I'm hearing now is the second.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">Goto's</STYLE> whatever-sound, the one she talked about, is ringing out eerily here in Arata too.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CREATECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\エデン\荒田枯れ木.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
The trees that had been lush with new leaves were withered.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
There's no way these dozens of trees could die in a matter of minutes.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{STOPSND "SE" "5000" "PASS"}
{PLAYSND "BGM死月編\深淵からの呼び声.ogg" "BGM" "REPEAT" "1000" "0"}
{CHANGECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\詫言編　夢から\秘密基地入口.gal" "NORMAL" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{CREATECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\美冬バストアップ.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "R" "B" "0" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="2">"</STYLE><STYLE ID="3">Haruka</STYLE><STYLE ID="2">, hurry back to the Niimura house! Get everyone somewhere safe!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">"What's that supposed to mean? What are </STYLE><STYLE ID="2">you</STYLE><STYLE ID="3"> going to do...?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">"I'll go look somewhere else."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">"No, no, come on. Let's go back together."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">"Now that it's come to this, we have to find </STYLE><STYLE ID="4">Chigaya-chan</STYLE><STYLE ID="2"> as soon as we can. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="2">Besides, if </STYLE><STYLE ID="5">Eiichiro-san</STYLE><STYLE ID="2"> and </STYLE><STYLE ID="6">Sakura-san</STYLE><STYLE ID="2"> really did take </STYLE><STYLE ID="4">Chigaya-chan</STYLE><STYLE ID="2">, I can talk to them."</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="3">"That's crazy! Dead bodies are walking around here!?</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="3">　Even if the voices sound exactly the same, they've got to be somebody else!</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="3">　If </STYLE><STYLE ID="2">you</STYLE><STYLE ID="3">'re going, then so am I!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">"It's dangerous!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">"I came here knowing it was dangerous. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="3">And you know what happened at Toyotake Station, right? </STYLE><STYLE ID="7">Shigatsu Youka</STYLE><STYLE ID="3"> has no intention of letting us get away."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">"............ </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="2">We come back as fast as we can. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="2">I have an idea where. Follow me!"</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{PLAYSND "SE\詫言編　夢から\砂利を走る.ogg" "VOICE" "REPEAT" "1000" "0"}
{CHANGECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\エデン\荒田枯れ木.gal" "NORMAL" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{DELETECG "人物1" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="2">Mom</STYLE> broke into a run through the forest, where you could now see clear through the trees.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
I went after <STYLE ID="2">Mom</STYLE>, but with all the fallen leaves and dead branches piled up, it was hard to run.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Every so often I saw small animals dashing past as if in a panic.<PG>
It seemed the animals had noticed this abnormal situation too, not just us.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">Goto</STYLE> has probably heard that sound and checked out the situation too, but what does she make of it?
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
So far, the only real damage is some dead trees, but...<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{STOPSND "BGM" "5000" "PASS"}
{PLAYSND "環境音\渓流.ogg" "SE" "REPEAT" "0" "0"}
{CHGVOL "SE" "700" "5000" "PASS"}
{CHANGECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\詫言編　夢から\墓場夜.gal" "NORMAL" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{CREATECG "アイテム1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\アイテム\墓石.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{STOPSND "VOICE" "500" "PASS"}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
The place <STYLE ID="2">Mom</STYLE> brought me to was the graveyard clearing.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
I could faintly hear the stream. 
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
And a single tall stone stood in place of a grave marker.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
By rights <STYLE ID="4">Chiga-nee</STYLE> was supposed to do the succession rite here tonight.<PG>
<STYLE ID="3">"Is </STYLE><STYLE ID="4">Chiga-nee</STYLE><STYLE ID="3"> here?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CREATECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\美冬バストアップ.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "R" "B" "100" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="2">"No. </STYLE><STYLE ID="5">Eiichiro-san</STYLE><STYLE ID="2"> and </STYLE><STYLE ID="6">Sakura-san</STYLE><STYLE ID="2"> were both buried here. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="2">If their bodies turned out not to be here..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">"You're not saying we should dig up the buried bodies..."</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\美冬うつむき.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "1000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="2">"If you don't like it, go back to the house."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">Mom</STYLE> was studying the ground around the gravestone closely, as if she really meant to dig.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">"O-okay, I get it, I'll help..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
After the mummy, buried bodies, huh...<PG>
<STYLE ID="3">"But how are we going to dig them up?</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="3">　They can't be that shallow, and we don't have any tools."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">"We're not digging them up. We're checking the ground around here. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="2">For any sign that it's been dug up, or that something has </STYLE><STYLE ID="8" RUBY="は">crawled</STYLE><STYLE ID="2"> out."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
I see. A burial pit would be deep and big, and not something you could fill back in so easily.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
A hole somebody came out of can't be completely covered up in just a few days.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\美冬バストアップ.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "1000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="2">"</STYLE><STYLE ID="3">Haruka</STYLE><STYLE ID="2">, you check from the mountain side. I'll go around from the stream side."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">"Got it!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{PLAYSND "エデンの桜\SE\walk-tussock1.ogg" "VOICE" "REPEAT" "1000" "0"}
{CHGVOL "SE" "0" "5000" "PASS"}
{DELETECG "000,人物1,アイテム1" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0"}
I headed in the exact opposite direction from <STYLE ID="2">Mom</STYLE>.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
The clearing is 100 meters square, and there's moonlight, so the two of us could finish checking it in 10 minutes or so.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CREATECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\エデン\墓地広場山側.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
I walked along the edge of the clearing, staring at the ground at my feet.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
But most of it was covered in short, dead grass, and nothing looked dug up.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
I looked about 10 meters ahead, but the ground was the same everywhere.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
If a body had come out, the grass in that spot would be gone.<PG>
No. If it were that easy to spot, the search parties in the daytime would have noticed something.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
I have to find any spot that feels even slightly off.<PG>
But even if we're talking about bodies <STYLE ID="9" RUBY="は">crawling</STYLE> out, they were buried more than 10 years ago, weren't they?
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
They should have been bare bones long ago, and yet the recording <STYLE ID="4">Chiga-nee</STYLE> made clearly caught voices of <STYLE ID="10" RUBY="・">flesh</STYLE> and blood.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
I'm no <STYLE ID="1">Goto</STYLE>, so there's no way I could know how something like that is even possible.<PG>
Come to think of it, maybe I should update <STYLE ID="1">Goto</STYLE> on the situation.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
I have to tell her we found the mummy, too.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{STOPSND "VOICE" "500" "PASS"}
{CREATECG "アイテム1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\アイテム\スマフォ青ストラップ切.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "650" "C" "0" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "500" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{PLAYSND "SE\携帯押す.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
{CHANGECG "アイテム1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\アイテム\スマフォ青ストラップ入.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "200" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
Damn, of course―no signal out here.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Wait, two messages from <STYLE ID="11">Natsumi</STYLE> had come in.<PG>
{PLAYSND "SE\携帯押す.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
<STYLE ID="12">"</STYLE><STYLE ID="13">Haruka</STYLE><STYLE ID="12">, are you okay? You haven't come back for ages, so I'm worried."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Right, I haven't told <STYLE ID="11">Natsumi</STYLE> anything.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
And even if I wanted to get in touch, there's nothing I can do with no signal...
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
I checked the other message.<PG>
{PLAYSND "SE\携帯押す.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
<STYLE ID="12">"I heard from a girl called </STYLE><STYLE ID="14">Kana-chan</STYLE><STYLE ID="12">―</STYLE><STYLE ID="13">you</STYLE><STYLE ID="12"> went to a cave with </STYLE><STYLE ID="15">Obasan</STYLE><STYLE ID="12">, right? To look for a mummy"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
So <STYLE ID="16">Kana</STYLE> had gone back to the house.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
I'll meet up with <STYLE ID="11">Natsumi</STYLE>, explain the situation, and―<PG>
{STOPSND "BGM" "0" "PASS"}
Wait, hold on! How much does <STYLE ID="11">Natsumi</STYLE> know!?
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
We're supposed to be keeping information away from her...!<PG>
{PLAYSND "BGM死月編\bgm_semarikuru.ogg" "BGM" "REPEAT" "1000" "0"}
Then everything we're doing is leaking straight to <STYLE ID="7">Shigatsu Youka</STYLE> too!
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Instead of straining to hide things any longer, I'll have to get <STYLE ID="11">Natsumi</STYLE> to shut her eyes and plug her ears...!
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
I'll leave the search here to <STYLE ID="2">Mom</STYLE> after all and hurry back!
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">"</STYLE><STYLE ID="2">Mom</STYLE><STYLE ID="3">! Something urgent came up, I'm going back to the house!"</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{STOPSND "BGM" "5000" "PASS"}
{CHGVOL "SE" "700" "5000" "PASS"}
{CHANGECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\詫言編　夢から\墓場夜.gal" "NORMAL" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{DELETECG "アイテム1" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
No answer.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Maybe she couldn't hear me over the stream.<PG>
I strained my eyes, but there was no sign of anyone.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
The gravestone and the dead standing trees were clear in the moonlight, yet I couldn't see <STYLE ID="2">Mom</STYLE> anywhere.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
She couldn't have pushed herself too hard and collapsed, could she!?
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{PLAYSND "エデンの桜\SE\walk-tussock1走る.ogg" "SE2" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
I ran the way <STYLE ID="2">Mom</STYLE> had gone, calling her name again and again.<PG>
Racing around a clearing 100 meters square was too much, even for me.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
I soon slowed to a walk and called for <STYLE ID="2">Mom</STYLE> even louder.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Turning from my hips up to my neck, I looked around a full 360 degrees.<PG>
<STYLE ID="3">"</STYLE><STYLE ID="2">Mom</STYLE><STYLE ID="3">! </STYLE><STYLE ID="2">Mom</STYLE><STYLE ID="3">, where are you! Answer me!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Is she just out of sight behind something?
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Or is the stream drowning out my voice after all?
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Or did <STYLE ID="2">Mom</STYLE> go down toward the bottom of the cliff?
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
I ran through every possibility, but no reason that made sense came to mind.<PG>
{PLAYSND "最後の声・真呪殺\z50逆.ogg" "BGM" "REPEAT" "1000" "0"}
I didn't want to admit it.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
I didn't want to admit that <STYLE ID="2">Mom</STYLE> had been kidnapped too.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
While I'd been walking with my eyes on the ground, had <STYLE ID="2">Mom</STYLE> been carried off?
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
No. Come to think of it, right near here there's...!<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHGVOL "SE" "800" "5000" "PASS"}
{CHANGECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\エデン\崖夜.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
This was the cliff <STYLE ID="6">Sakura-san</STYLE> is said to have fallen from.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
It was possible that <STYLE ID="2">Mom</STYLE> had slipped and fallen from here, too.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
But which was more likely: that <STYLE ID="2">Mom</STYLE> had been carried off, or that for some reason she'd left the clearing and stupidly slipped off the cliff?
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Even I know that heading toward the stream right now is a waste of time.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{PLAYSND "SE\詫言編　夢から\砂利を走る.ogg" "VOICE" "REPEAT" "1000" "0"}
{CHANGECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\エデン\崖沿いの道.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
No. Maybe <STYLE ID="2">Mom</STYLE> was pushed off the cliff by someone.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
From here, it'll take me at least 10 minutes on foot to reach the bottom of the cliff.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Even while I stand here, <STYLE ID="2">Mom</STYLE> might be getting farther and farther away.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Or she could be stuck at the bottom of the cliff, unable to move, suffering, and at worst...!<PG>
<STYLE ID="3">"</STYLE><STYLE ID="2">Mom</STYLE><STYLE ID="3">!</STYLE><STYLE ID="2"> Mooom</STYLE><STYLE ID="3">, where are you!!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
The refreshing babble of the stream nearby was really grating at a time like this.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
If it weren't for that babbling, my voice would reach <STYLE ID="2">Mom</STYLE> so much more easily.
